  "summary": "Desktop shell for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI: a Node/Electron-based desktop application that embeds the dsh web interface in a chromeless native window. Launching it starts the dsh web service hidden when needed — the URL and the underlying dsh web command are never shown to the user. Hot-pluggable: mounted via the profile bundle patch + the dsh client declaration, no dsh source changes.",
